  "body_lines": [
   "Each person sees only their own YES or NO card. Everyone knows the cards can be dealt in any",
   "way.",
   "In order, people 1, 2, 3 answer \u201cDoes everyone want a cup?\u201d Say YES or NO when the cards and",
   "earlier answers settle it. Otherwise say NOT YET.",
   "With two people, hearing the first answer changes the possibilities:",
   "Before Heard After",
   "1 2 1 2",
   "YES YES",
   "Person 1 says NO.",
   "YES NO NO YES",
   "Their own card must be NO.",
   "NO YES NO NO",
   "NO NO",
   "Problem 1: Make every YES/NO deal that fits each conversation. Use the eight deal cards; start",
   "with all eight for each conversation.",
   "Conversation 1 Conversation 2",
   "1 NOT YET 1 NO",
   "2 NOT YET 2 NO",
   "3 NO 3 NO",
   "Conversation 3 Conversation 4",
   "1 NOT YET 1 NOT YET",
   "2 NO 2 NOT YET",
   "3 NO 3 YES"
